<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea Flour seeks 17,300 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Korea Flour seeks 17,300 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Flour Milling Corp invited on Friday tenders for 17,300 tonnes of U.S. wheat, traders said.</p>
<p>Traders said shipment was set for December 10-January 10 from the Pacific Northwest to the western port city of Inchon.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
